        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#1c1712;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#2a2118'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:3.4cqw 5cqw 4cqw;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#ecdcb0,#d8c08a 55%,#c8ae78);border:.5cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.2cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a'>Expedition file · born 1899</div><div style='font:700 6.4cqw/1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2a2118;margin:1.2cqw 0 .6cqw'>Indiana Jones</div><div style='font:italic 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#6b4a22'>Archaeologist and university professor · adventurer</div><section style='margin-top:2.4cqw;padding-top:0cqw;'><div style='width:100%;aspect-ratio:780 / 590;border-radius:1.2cqw;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 .4cqw 1.2cqw rgba(42,33,24,.35)'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 780 590' width='100%' height='100%' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid meet' role='img' aria-label='Indiana Jones character dossier'><defs><linearGradient id='paper' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#e9d6a7'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#b79a65'/></linearGradient><linearGradient id='night' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#63513a'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#211b15'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='780' height='590' rx='14' fill='url(#paper)'/><rect x='15' y='15' width='750' height='560' rx='6' fill='none' stroke='#735938' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M36 104H744M36 481H744' stroke='#735938' stroke-width='2'/><text x='38' y='47' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='14' letter-spacing='4' fill='#63482e'>ARCHAEOLOGICAL FIELD DOSSIER</text><text x='742' y='47' font-family='monospace' font-size='13' text-anchor='end' fill='#63482e'>FILE 001 / CLASSIFIED</text><text x='390' y='92' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='51' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' fill='#392719'>INDIANA JONES</text><rect x='38' y='123' width='340' height='343' rx='5' fill='url(#night)'/><circle cx='209' cy='267' r='117' fill='#8c6c45' opacity='.16'/><path d='M119 415Q125 341 167 328L185 306L232 306L257 330Q305 339 318 415Z' fill='#463426' stroke='#17130e' stroke-width='4'/><path d='M156 340L180 321L206 375L233 321L260 340L244 412H175Z' fill='#a68c67'/><path d='M188 340L205 370L221 340L213 416H197Z' fill='#3b3026'/><path d='M165 248Q161 190 208 177Q257 194 251 252L246 291Q231 328 210 330Q182 329 169 293Z' fill='#ad875d' stroke='#3d2c1f' stroke-width='3'/><path d='M178 269L197 264M222 264L241 269' stroke='#34271d' stroke-width='5' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M199 298Q211 304 224 297' stroke='#543723' stroke-width='3' fill='none'/><path d='M144 216Q149 177 163 155Q192 141 245 154Q266 170 271 216L252 228H160Z' fill='#483728' stroke='#22180f' stroke-width='4'/><path d='M112 223Q210 249 303 222Q309 212 289 209L271 208L145 208L124 208Q107 211 112 223Z' fill='#3c2b20'/><path d='M149 209H266' stroke='#98653b' stroke-width='10'/><path d='M280 342Q333 379 303 427Q272 462 321 454Q350 448 345 422' fill='none' stroke='#b78e53' stroke-width='9' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='208' y='448' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace' font-size='11' fill='#dbc49a' letter-spacing='2'>FIELD PORTRAIT / ARTIST RENDERING</text><text x='406' y='158' font-family='monospace' font-size='14' fill='#735938'>FULL NAME</text><text x='406' y='186' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='23' fill='#392719'>Henry Walton Jones Jr.</text><path d='M407 198H735' stroke='#b39868'/><text x='406' y='225' font-family='monospace' font-size='14' fill='#735938'>OCCUPATION</text><text x='406' y='252' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='23' fill='#392719'>Archaeologist / Professor</text><path d='M407 265H735' stroke='#b39868'/><text x='406' y='291' font-family='monospace' font-size='14' fill='#735938'>SPECIALTIES</text><text x='406' y='319' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='21' fill='#392719'>Ancient history</text><text x='406' y='346' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='21' fill='#392719'>Languages / Survival</text><path d='M407 361H735' stroke='#b39868'/><text x='406' y='390' font-family='monospace' font-size='14' fill='#735938'>DISTINGUISHING FEATURES</text><text x='406' y='420' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='20' fill='#392719'>Fedora · Leather jacket</text><text x='406' y='449' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='20' fill='#392719'>Bullwhip · Unusual luck</text><text x='390' y='520' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='28' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle' fill='#51351f'>It belongs in a museum!</text><text x='390' y='552' font-family='monospace' font-size='12' letter-spacing='3' text-anchor='middle' fill='#735938'>ADVENTURER · SCHOLAR · RELUCTANT HERO</text></svg></div></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>01 · Character Profile</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>The Man Behind the Fedora</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Full name:</b> Dr. Henry Walton Jones Jr.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Nickname:</b> Indiana</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Born:</b> July 1, 1899</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Nationality:</b> American</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Profession:</b> Archaeologist and university professor</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Portrayed by:</b> Harrison Ford (primarily)</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Creator:</b> George Lucas</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>First appearance:</b> <i>Raiders of the Lost Ark</i> (1981)</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #b99152;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Personality</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Brave, stubborn, cynical, witty, resourceful and intensely curious.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Indy is a scholar who would rather face an ancient death trap than admit he has reached a dead end.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>He possesses extraordinary knowledge, but survives as often through improvisation and sheer determination as through expertise.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>02 · Field Abilities</div><div style='width:100%;aspect-ratio:490 / 430;border-radius:1.2cqw;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 .4cqw 1.2cqw rgba(42,33,24,.35)'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 490 430' width='100%' height='100%' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid meet' role='img' aria-label='Indiana Jones field abilities'><rect width='490' height='430' rx='16' fill='#272319'/><text x='30' y='47' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='29' font-weight='bold' fill='#f3ddb1'>FIELD ABILITIES</text><text x='30' y='72' font-family='monospace' font-size='12' fill='#ab9369'>ILLUSTRATIVE RATINGS / 10</text><g font-family='system-ui' font-size='15' fill='#f3e7ce'><text x='30' y='111'>ARCHAEOLOGY</text><text x='30' y='151'>COURAGE</text><text x='30' y='191'>RESOURCEFULNESS</text><text x='30' y='231'>LANGUAGES</text><text x='30' y='271'>COMBAT</text><text x='30' y='311'>SURVIVAL</text><text x='30' y='351'>DIPLOMACY</text><text x='30' y='391'>LUCK</text></g><g fill='#554936'><rect x='204' y='94' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='134' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='174' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='214' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='254' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='294' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='334' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='374' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/></g><g fill='#c49a55'><rect x='204' y='94' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='134' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='174' width='203' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='214' width='203' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='254' width='181' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='294' width='203' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='334' width='136' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='374' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/></g></svg></div></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>03 · Signature Equipment</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>Field Equipment</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Fedora</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>His battered brown fedora is practically part of his identity. He goes to extraordinary lengths to recover it.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Bullwhip</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A tool for swinging across gaps, disarming opponents and improvising escapes. Almost as iconic as the hat.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Leather Jacket</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A rugged travel companion that has survived more punishment than most expedition equipment.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Revolver</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Usually a practical backup weapon rather than his preferred solution.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Satchel</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Carries maps, journals, artifacts and whatever else the expedition requires.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #b99152;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Field philosophy:</b> Travel light. Think quickly. Expect everything to go wrong.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>04 · Strengths and Weaknesses</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>Strengths &amp; Flaws</div><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>Strengths</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Exceptional intellect:</b> Extensive knowledge of ancient history, archaeology, and languages.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Improvisation:</b> Turns desperate situations into opportunities.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Resilience:</b> Keeps fighting long after a sensible person would surrender.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Moral courage:</b> Frequently risks his life to protect others and preserve history.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #b99152;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>Weaknesses</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Ophidiophobia:</b> An intense fear of snakes.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Impulsiveness:</b> Sometimes acts before considering the consequences.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Obsession:</b> His pursuit of historical mysteries can damage relationships.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Physical vulnerability:</b> He gets injured, exhausted and overwhelmed.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Pride:</b> He sometimes confuses stubbornness with certainty.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>05 · Defining Relationships</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>Allies, Family &amp; Rivals</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Henry Jones Sr.</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Father / Scholar</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A medieval literature professor whose relationship with Indiana is strained by years of emotional distance. Their search for the Grail brings reconciliation.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Marion Ravenwood</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Romantic Partner</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Independent, sharp-tongued and fearless. One of the few people who can consistently challenge Indiana on equal terms.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Marcus Brody</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Friend / Museum Curator</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A trusted academic colleague who supports Indiana&#39;s expeditions.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>Sallah</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Friend / Excavator</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A loyal and resourceful ally, particularly during adventures in Egypt.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>René Belloq</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Rival Archaeologist</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>An intellectual mirror of Indiana, willing to abandon ethics in pursuit of discovery.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>06 · Legendary Expeditions</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>Legendary Expeditions</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>1935 | The Temple of Doom</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Objective:</b> Recover the stolen Sankara Stone and rescue enslaved children.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Threat:</b> A violent cult beneath Pankot Palace.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>1936 | Raiders of the Lost Ark</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Objective:</b> Find the Ark of the Covenant before the Nazis.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Threat:</b> René Belloq, the Nazi expedition, and the Ark&#39;s supernatural power.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>1938 | The Last Crusade</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Objective:</b> Find his missing father and discover the Holy Grail.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Threat:</b> Nazi treasure hunters and deadly Grail trials.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>1957 | Kingdom of the Crystal Skull</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Objective:</b> Investigate the mystery of the crystal skull.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Threat:</b> Soviet agents and extraordinary extraterrestrial mysteries.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>1969 | Dial of Destiny</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Objective:</b> Prevent an ancient device associated with Archimedes from being exploited.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Threat:</b> Jürgen Voller and his ambitions to change history.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #b99152;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Recurring theme:</b> Ancient artifacts promise extraordinary power, but those who seek to possess that power frequently misunderstand its cost.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>07 · Character Psychology</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>The Heart of the Character</div><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>What does he want?</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>To discover, understand and preserve the extraordinary remnants of human history.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>What does he need?</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>To recognize that relationships and human lives matter more than artifacts or academic achievement.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>His central contradiction</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Indiana Jones is a rational scholar whose greatest adventures repeatedly confront him with the supernatural.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>He trusts evidence, but the world keeps revealing mysteries that exceed his expectations.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>His heroic flaw</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>His determination makes him extraordinary, but his obsession can make him careless with the people closest to him.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#6b4a22'>His defining quality</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>He is brave without being invulnerable.</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>His victories are convincing because he suffers, fails, improvises and persists.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #b99152'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;margin-bottom:1cqw'>08 · Character Essence</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#2a2118'>INDIANA JONES</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#6b4a22;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Scholar Who Refuses to Stay in the Library</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Archetype:</b> Adventurer / Explorer / Reluctant Hero</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Motivation:</b> Discovery, preservation and the pursuit of historical truth.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Greatest strength:</b> Resourcefulness under impossible pressure.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Greatest weakness:</b> Obsession, pride and a spectacular fear of snakes.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Internal conflict:</b> Scientific skepticism versus extraordinary experience.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#2a2118'>Character arc:</b> Learning that the people beside him matter more than the treasures ahead.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #b99152;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><i>He isn&#39;t the strongest man in the room. He isn&#39;t the most dangerous. He&#39;s simply the man who keeps getting back up.</i></p></section><div style='margin-top:3.6cqw;font:400 1.1cqw/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a3a;text-align:center'>9 sections, assembled in reading order</div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the whole dossier as one document. The Method writes it from the section cards, in reading order, so edit those and not this.",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
