      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# The Man Behind the Fedora\n\n**Full name:** Dr. Henry Walton Jones Jr.\n\n**Nickname:** Indiana\n\n**Born:** July 1, 1899\n\n**Nationality:** American\n\n**Profession:** Archaeologist and university professor\n\n**Portrayed by:** Harrison Ford (primarily)\n\n**Creator:** George Lucas\n\n**First appearance:** *Raiders of the Lost Ark* (1981)\n\n---\n\n### Personality\n\nBrave, stubborn, cynical, witty, resourceful and intensely curious.\n\nIndy is a scholar who would rather face an ancient death trap than admit he has reached a dead end.\n\nHe possesses extraordinary knowledge, but survives as often through improvisation and sheer determination as through expertise."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "cfef98fa-2f89-4b39-b69f-b2bbcfc3ba74"
        },
