        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Field Equipment\n\n### The Fedora\nHis battered brown fedora is practically part of his identity. He goes to extraordinary lengths to recover it.\n\n### The Bullwhip\nA tool for swinging across gaps, disarming opponents and improvising escapes. Almost as iconic as the hat.\n\n### Leather Jacket\nA rugged travel companion that has survived more punishment than most expedition equipment.\n\n### Revolver\nUsually a practical backup weapon rather than his preferred solution.\n\n### Satchel\nCarries maps, journals, artifacts and whatever else the expedition requires.\n\n---\n\n**Field philosophy:** Travel light. Think quickly. Expect everything to go wrong."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "cfef98fa-2f89-4b39-b69f-b2bbcfc3ba74"
