        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "background": "#29241c",
        "color": "#f3e7ce",
        "borderColor": "#b99152",
        "borderWidth": 2,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Allies, Family & Rivals\n\n### Henry Jones Sr.\n**Father / Scholar**\n\nA medieval literature professor whose relationship with Indiana is strained by years of emotional distance. Their search for the Grail brings reconciliation.\n\n### Marion Ravenwood\n**Romantic Partner**\n\nIndependent, sharp-tongued and fearless. One of the few people who can consistently challenge Indiana on equal terms.\n\n### Marcus Brody\n**Friend / Museum Curator**\n\nA trusted academic colleague who supports Indiana's expeditions.\n\n### Sallah\n**Friend / Excavator**\n\nA loyal and resourceful ally, particularly during adventures in Egypt.\n\n### René Belloq\n**Rival Archaeologist**\n\nAn intellectual mirror of Indiana, willing to abandon ethics in pursuit of discovery."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "cfef98fa-2f89-4b39-b69f-b2bbcfc3ba74"
