        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "background": "#29241c",
        "color": "#f3e7ce",
        "borderColor": "#b99152",
        "borderWidth": 2,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Legendary Expeditions\n\n### 1935 | The Temple of Doom\n**Objective:** Recover the stolen Sankara Stone and rescue enslaved children.\n\n**Threat:** A violent cult beneath Pankot Palace.\n\n### 1936 | Raiders of the Lost Ark\n**Objective:** Find the Ark of the Covenant before the Nazis.\n\n**Threat:** René Belloq, the Nazi expedition, and the Ark's supernatural power.\n\n### 1938 | The Last Crusade\n**Objective:** Find his missing father and discover the Holy Grail.\n\n**Threat:** Nazi treasure hunters and deadly Grail trials.\n\n### 1957 | Kingdom of the Crystal Skull\n**Objective:** Investigate the mystery of the crystal skull.\n\n**Threat:** Soviet agents and extraordinary extraterrestrial mysteries.\n\n### 1969 | Dial of Destiny\n**Objective:** Prevent an ancient device associated with Archimedes from being exploited.\n\n**Threat:** Jürgen Voller and his ambitions to change history.\n\n---\n\n**Recurring theme:** Ancient artifacts promise extraordinary power, but those who seek to possess that power frequently misunderstand its cost."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "cfef98fa-2f89-4b39-b69f-b2bbcfc3ba74"
